            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>This aerosol generation device is provided with: a heater configured so as to be capable of heating the outer circumference of a smoking article including an aerosol source; and a controller for controlling the heater. The controller is configured to control the heater so that an aerosol delivery profile in a preset period in which suction is possible includes one or more local maximum values between the start point and the end point of the period in which suction is possible.</p>
